#~ msgid "A skill is a documented, schema-bounded unit of work (e.g. ). Skills are grouped into packages that declare their Docker/runtime dependencies via a . The LLM discovers skills with  and loads instructions with . The full list of skills and roles — and how they compose with the LLM (RBAC, capabilities, requirements) — is on the Skills & roles page; each skill's input/output contract is published in the Skill schema reference."
